{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"fangji-e-303492a496789999bb58","title":"裴松之辨管辂年龄与本命记载不相应","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-303492a496789999bb58","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之辨管辂年龄与本命记载不相应","evidence":["fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c","order":6079}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-c0cb38d365a1f1f81a0c","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-aa9e853e57c2b927ec50","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：辰所称“乡里刘太常者”，谓刘寔也；辰撰辂传，寔时为太常。“颍川”则寔弟智也。寔、智并以儒学为名，无能言之；《世语》称寔“博辩”，犹不足以并裴、何之流也。又按辂自说，云“本命在寅”，则建安十五年生也。至正始九年，应三十九，而传云三十六；以正元三年卒，应四十七，传云四十八：皆为不相应也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-66647f1ecb147317b0c6","start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
